{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll &amp; Win CASINO PARTY is a casino-style board game where players aim for first place on the board while earning chips through casino games.<br>As you roll the dice and move across the board, various casino games and events are triggered, causing your chip count to increase or decrease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to luck, your choices along the way can significantly affect the outcome of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports up to six players and also includes a single-player mode with CPU opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll &amp; Win Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357870/extras/344fa4717c32800ebd992ccb032077dc.poster.avif?t=1773041547\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357870/extras/344fa4717c32800ebd992ccb032077dc.webm?t=1773041547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357870/extras/344fa4717c32800ebd992ccb032077dc.mp4?t=1773041547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll &amp; Win Mode is the main mode of the game, where players advance across the board while collecting chips and competing for first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board features a variety of events and special-effect cards, creating a different flow each time you play.<br>Until the very end, the winner remains uncertain, making every match exciting and unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini-Game Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357870/extras/e09f26b59943014fd8331da2d39ebf76.poster.avif?t=1773041547\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357870/extras/e09f26b59943014fd8331da2d39ebf76.webm?t=1773041547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357870/extras/e09f26b59943014fd8331da2d39ebf76.mp4?t=1773041547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Game Mode allows players to enjoy casino games on their own, without playing the board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode includes 14 different mini-games, such as poker and roulette, and is ideal for players who want to enjoy casino games casually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skin Edit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pieces used in Roll &amp; Win Mode can be customized by changing their skins.<br>You can adjust their appearance and play using pieces that match your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Skin edits do not affect gameplay progression or game balance.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Focus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title emphasizes simple rules and smooth, fast-paced gameplay.<br>Rather than a game designed for long, continuous play sessions, it is intended for players who want to enjoy roll &amp; win and casino elements in a casual and accessible way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To receive news and update notifications</strong><br>Please click on <strong>Developer: SAT-BOX</strong> at the top of the store page and <strong>Follow</strong> us!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357870?t=1773041547","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357870?t=1773041547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357870/b2fdc6e0faf5db53c24305733a98ab0700ad94e7/capsule